==Description==
'''Gum Drop''' was a form of non-spendable season currency that could have been earned during the [[Null & Void Event]] on any map and gamemode. They were obtainable by killing enemies which each had a chance to drop '''Gum Drops''', though these enemies had no special accessories to indicate that they would drop '''Gum Drops'''. 

They were used to complete Levels on the [[Null & Void Event|Null & Void Battle Pass]]. The amount earned per wave varied based on the gamemode played.

It took the appearance of a purple gum drop.

